{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "WetDeposition",
    "description": "EMEP wet deposition for particles, SO2 and other soluble gases (upstream WetDeposition). First-order rates k = W*P/(h_s*rho_water), with precipitation flux P = qrain*Vdr*rho_air, sub-cloud and cloudFrac-weighted in-cloud scavenging ratios W from EMEP Status Report 1/2003 Table 9.1 (times 1e6, the tabulated unit), and the fixed EMEP scavenging depth h_s = 1000 m; the particle sub-cloud term is A_wd*E*qrain*rho_air.",
    "tags": [
      "atmospheric_deposition",
      "emep",
      "wet-deposition",
      "scavenging",
      "observed-only"
    ],
    "created": "2026-05-30T00:00:00Z",
    "authors": [
      "AtmosphericDeposition.jl contributors",
      "EarthSciModels migration (esm-h955)"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "EMEP (2003). EMEP MSC-W Status Report 2003: Transboundary Acidification, Eutrophication and Ground Level Ozone in Europe. EMEP Report 1/2003, Part I. https://www.emep.int/publ/reports/2003/emep_report_1_part1_2003.pdf. Wet scavenging parameterisation used by WetDeposition."
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "WetDeposition": {
      "reference": {
        "citation": "EMEP (2003). EMEP MSC-W Status Report 2003: Transboundary Acidification, Eutrophication and Ground Level Ozone in Europe. EMEP Report 1/2003, Part I. https://www.emep.int/publ/reports/2003/emep_report_1_part1_2003.pdf.",
        "notes": "source_ref: jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only):src/wet_deposition.jl _WetDeposition / WetDeposition.\n\nChanges against the previous revision (AtmosphericDeposition.jl@e4468c79), all upstream: the EMEP scavenging ratios are the Table 9.1 entries times 1e6 (the table lists W x 1e-6; using the bare entries made gas and in-cloud wet deposition a no-op, with lifetimes of years); the in-cloud term uses the in-cloud ratios (SO2 0.3e6, other gases 1.4e6) where it used the sub-cloud ones; the gas and in-cloud rates divide by the fixed scavenging depth h_s = 1000 m instead of the local layer thickness, which made every layer remove the rain's full carrying capacity; and the `lev` input and its 72-level depth table are gone, since nothing uses them.\n\nTolerance rationale (model rel = 1e-9): closed-form arithmetic on Float64 constants; expected values are upstream's _WetDeposition at the test inputs."
      },
      "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-09
      },
      "variables": {
        "cloudFrac": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.5,
          "description": "Fraction of the grid cell covered by clouds (dimensionless, upstream cloudFrac @parameter)."
        },
        "qrain": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.5,
          "description": "Rain mixing ratio (dimensionless, upstream qrain @parameter)."
        },
        "rho_air": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "default": 1.204,
          "description": "Air density (upstream ρ_air @parameter, migrated as ASCII rho_air)."
        },
        "A_wd": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m^3/(kg*s)",
          "default": 5.2,
          "description": "Empirical wet deposition coefficient (upstream module @constant A_wd)."
        },
        "rho_water": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "default": 1000.0,
          "description": "Water density (upstream module @constant ρwater)."
        },
        "Vdr": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 5.0,
          "description": "Raindrop fall speed (upstream module @constant Vdr)."
        },
        "i_rain": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Rain presence indicator: 1 if qrain > 0, else 0. Guards against negative qrain (upstream `i = ifelse(qrain > 0, 1, 0)`, src/wet_deposition.jl:109)."
        },
        "k_particle": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "First-order wet deposition rate for particles [1/s]: i_rain*qrain*rho_air*(A_wd*E + cloudFrac*W_in*Vdr/(rho_water*h_s)) with E = 0.1 and in-cloud ratio W_in = 1.0e6 (EMEP)."
        },
        "k_SO2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "First-order wet deposition rate for SO2 [1/s]: i_rain*(W_sub + cloudFrac*W_in)*Vdr/rho_water*qrain*rho_air/h_s with sub-cloud W_sub = 0.15e6 and in-cloud W_in = 0.3e6 (EMEP)."
        },
        "k_othergas": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "First-order wet deposition rate for other soluble gases [1/s]: i_rain*(W_sub + cloudFrac*W_in)*Vdr/rho_water*qrain*rho_air/h_s with W_sub = 0.5e6 and W_in = 1.4e6 (EMEP)."
        },
        "h_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 1000.0,
          "description": "EMEP characteristic scavenging depth [m] (Simpson et al. 2003, EMEP Status Report 1/2003 Part I, Ch. 9). Upstream module @constant h_s. The gas and in-cloud rates divide by this fixed depth, not by the local layer thickness."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "i_rain",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": ">",
                "args": [
                  "qrain",
                  0
                ]
              },
              1,
              0
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "k_particle",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "i_rain",
              "qrain",
              "rho_air",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "A_wd",
                      0.1
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "cloudFrac",
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  1000000.0,
                                  "Vdr"
                                ]
                              },
                              "rho_water"
                            ]
                          },
                          "h_s"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "k_SO2",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "i_rain",
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              150000.0,
                              "Vdr"
                            ]
                          },
                          "rho_water"
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          "cloudFrac",
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  300000.0,
                                  "Vdr"
                                ]
                              },
                              "rho_water"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "qrain",
                  "rho_air"
                ]
              },
              "h_s"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "k_othergas",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "i_rain",
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              500000.0,
                              "Vdr"
                            ]
                          },
                          "rho_water"
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          "cloudFrac",
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  1400000.0,
                                  "Vdr"
                                ]
                              },
                              "rho_water"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "qrain",
                  "rho_air"
                ]
              },
              "h_s"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "defaults",
          "description": "cloudFrac = 0.5, qrain = 0.5, rho_air = 1.204 kg/m3. Expected values are upstream's _WetDeposition at these inputs (jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only)).",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "cloudFrac": 0.5,
            "qrain": 0.5,
            "rho_air": 1.204
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "i_rain",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_particle",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.8180399999999999
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_SO2",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.903
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_othergas",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 3.612
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "light_rain_partly_cloudy",
          "description": "cloudFrac = 0.3, qrain = 2e-05, rho_air = 1.15 kg/m3. Expected values are upstream's _WetDeposition at these inputs (jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only)).",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "cloudFrac": 0.3,
            "qrain": 2e-05,
            "rho_air": 1.15
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "i_rain",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_particle",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 4.646e-05
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_SO2",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 2.76e-05
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_othergas",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.00010580000000000001
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "heavy_rain_overcast",
          "description": "cloudFrac = 1.0, qrain = 0.0004, rho_air = 1.2 kg/m3. Expected values are upstream's _WetDeposition at these inputs (jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only)).",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "cloudFrac": 1.0,
            "qrain": 0.0004,
            "rho_air": 1.2
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "i_rain",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_particle",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0026496
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_SO2",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.00108
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_othergas",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.004560000000000001
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rain_no_cloud",
          "description": "cloudFrac = 0.0, qrain = 0.0001, rho_air = 1.1 kg/m3. Expected values are upstream's _WetDeposition at these inputs (jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only)).",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "cloudFrac": 0.0,
            "qrain": 0.0001,
            "rho_air": 1.1
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "i_rain",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_particle",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 5.7200000000000015e-05
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_SO2",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 8.25e-05
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_othergas",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.00027500000000000007
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "no_rain",
          "description": "cloudFrac = 0.8, qrain = 0, rho_air = 1.2 kg/m3. Expected values are upstream's _WetDeposition at these inputs (jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only)).",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "cloudFrac": 0.8,
            "qrain": 0.0,
            "rho_air": 1.2
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "i_rain",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_particle",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_SO2",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0
            },
            {
              "variable": "k_othergas",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "analyses": [
        {
          "id": "deposition_rates_vs_qrain_and_cloudFrac",
          "description": "Wet deposition rates as a joint function of rain mixing ratio (qrain) and cloud fraction (cloudFrac) at lev=1. All three rates scale linearly with qrain; the gas rates additionally scale with (1 + cloudFrac) and the particle in-cloud term scales with cloudFrac.",
          "initial_state": {},
          "parameters": {
            "rho_air": 1.204,
            "lev": 1,
            "A_wd": 5.2,
            "rho_water": 1000.0,
            "Vdr": 5.0
          },
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "parameter_sweep": {
            "type": "cartesian",
            "dimensions": [
              {
                "parameter": "qrain",
                "range": {
                  "start": 0.0,
                  "stop": 1.0,
                  "count": 11,
                  "scale": "linear"
                }
              },
              {
                "parameter": "cloudFrac",
                "range": {
                  "start": 0.0,
                  "stop": 1.0,
                  "count": 6,
                  "scale": "linear"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "plots": [
            {
              "id": "particle_heatmap",
              "type": "heatmap",
              "description": "PM2.5 wet deposition rate k_particle as a function of qrain and cloudFrac.",
              "x": {
                "variable": "qrain",
                "label": "Rain mixing ratio"
              },
              "y": {
                "variable": "cloudFrac",
                "label": "Cloud fraction"
              },
              "value": {
                "variable": "k_particle",
                "reduce": "final"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
